    "description": "A tooltip: shows the name or a short hint of a control while it is hovered or focused — a layer of the platform (popover) anchored to its trigger, gone with Escape, standing while the pointer is over it."
  },
  "skemo": {
    "id": "ske_01M564NX6FGBH4NHKDSHCCM5W3",
    "ero": "ero_01M564NWTCRSFC8QEB9TZKQB0C",
